  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-14-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- `pipx list --short --include-injected` now lists injected packages, as `--pinned --include-injected` already does ([#2415](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2415)) by @Pixeless001 and @gaborbernat.\n- `pipx uninject` matches package names in any spelling, so `mixed-case` finds a package that pip recorded as `Mixed_Case`, and it refuses the main package however the name is spelled ([#2420](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2420)) by @guransh0925 and @gaborbernat.\n\n### New Contributors\n\n- @guransh0925 made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2417\n- @Pixeless001 made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2415\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.14/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.13...1.18.14)\n",
